{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03742","headline":"奉和杜员外扈从教阅 · 李峤","name":"奉和杜员外扈从教阅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杪冬严杀气，穷纪送颓光。\n薄狩三农隙，大阅五戎塲。\n菜田初起烧，兰野正开防。\n夹岸虹旗转，分朋兽罟张。\n燕弧带晓月，吴劒动秋霜。\n原啓前禽路，山萦後骑行。\n云区坠日羽，星苑毙天狼。\n礼振军容肃，威宣武节扬。\n神心体殷祝，灵兆叶姬祥。\n幸陪仙驾末，欣采翰林芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03742.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03742","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}